Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,What if Vegeta got one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.86,0:00:01.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,peaceful week?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.92,0:00:02.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,No invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.92,0:00:04.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,A prince underqualified for\Nnormal
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:05.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tuesday activities.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,He begins by training harder.\NNaturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.90,0:00:09.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bro treats relaxation like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:10.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,security vulnerability in his\Nsystem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.82,0:00:12.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bulma requests family time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.48,0:00:13.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Vegeta asks for the objective.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,Sir, the objective is being\Npresent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.64,0:00:17.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Trunks shows him a drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.10,0:00:18.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Vegeta corrects his stance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.32,0:00:19.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,My guy, that's artwork, not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.52,0:00:20.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,an enemy combatant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:21.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Without a threat, strength needs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.65,0:00:22.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,another purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.69,0:00:24.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,Can he enjoy people he protects?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.09,0:00:25.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Goku visits.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Vegeta immediately suspects\Nsecret training.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:28.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,A friendly hello triggers a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.43,0:00:29.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,competitive investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.71,0:00:31.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,He wants gravity training again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.17,0:00:32.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Instead, he promises a short
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:33.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,session and leaves on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:34.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Bulma is shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.97,0:00:36.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,A grown man correctly estimated
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.23,0:00:37.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,his arrival time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.69,0:00:39.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,Historic scenes at Capsule\NCorporation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.11,0:00:39.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:40.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,He listens to Trunks explain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.83,0:00:41.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,the drawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.67,0:00:42.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,It's their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.59,0:00:43.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Nobody's fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:44.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Vegeta needs a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.67,0:00:45.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,He keeps his pride, but
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.47,0:00:47.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,stops dodging tender\Nconversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.53,0:00:49.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,An actual emotional upgrade.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.05,0:00:50.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,Goku asks if peace made
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.15,0:00:51.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,him soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.01,0:00:53.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Vegeta schedules tomorrow's\Nbeating.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,Healthy boundaries, absolutely\Nhorrible phrasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.43,0:00:56.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,No new transformation appears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.97,0:00:58.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,He still grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.15,0:00:59.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,Motherflicker, the breakthrough\Nwas dinner
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.27,0:01:00.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,together and one sincere\Ncompliment.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.44,Heading,,0,0,0,,NO VILLAIN JUST FEELINGS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:05.44,0:00:10.71,Heading,,0,0,0,,DAY ONE OF RELAXING
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.71,0:00:15.55,Heading,,0,0,0,,BULMA SETS THE CHALLENGE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.55,0:00:20.47,Heading,,0,0,0,,NOT EVERYTHING IS A DRILL
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.47,0:00:24.05,Heading,,0,0,0,,WHAT IS STRENGTH FOR
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.05,0:00:29.67,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE RIVALRY NOTIFICATION
Dialogue: 1,0:00:29.67,0:00:33.81,Heading,,0,0,0,,PUT THE GRAVITY DOWN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:33.81,0:00:39.81,Heading,,0,0,0,,A RARE CONFIRMED WIN
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.81,0:00:44.60,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE SMALL MOMENT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.60,0:00:49.03,Heading,,0,0,0,,KEEP THE PRIDE LOSE THE EXCUSE
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.03,0:00:55.34,Heading,,0,0,0,,THE FLEX STILL EXISTS
Dialogue: 1,0:00:55.34,0:01:01.00,Heading,,0,0,0,,A DIFFERENT KIND OF POWER
